## What it is

**Sentinel** is an LLM-free, embeddable safety companion. It answers “is it safe here right now?” for weather, wildfire, and flood using **paid ATLAS capabilities** on [AIMarket](https://modelmarket.dev) and **deterministic thresholds**. Every statement can carry a **signed evidence receipt**.

Invented and built by [AI-Factory](https://github.com/alexar76/aicom).

## What it is not

Not a forecast. Not an LLM opinion. Not an insurance or regulatory clearance.

